# Density Compare
# Moscovium (Mc) — real density 13.5 g/cm³. equal masses: Moscovium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Moscovium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.4mm color: #ff7040 at (-20mm, 4.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 107.7 g — the water cube is the reference
